sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant API as Metadata API
    participant Blob as Object store
    participant CDN as CDN
    Cl->>Cl: chunk and hash the file
    Cl->>API: which chunks are new?
    API-->>Cl: only the missing hashes
    API-->>Cl: presigned upload URLs
    Cl->>Blob: PUT chunks directly
    Note over Cl,Blob: bytes never pass through your application tier
    Cl->>API: commit the version
    Cl->>API: download a file
    API-->>Cl: manifest plus presigned GETs
    Cl->>CDN: fetch chunks
    CDN-->>Cl: edge-cached
